# The repo is LF-everywhere, including Windows working trees: bash scripts,
# vitest-imported .mjs generators, and byte-compared generated mirrors all
# break under CRLF smudging (core.autocrlf). Only cmd.exe scripts stay CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
# Generated deterministic ZIP archives (scripts/generate-streamdeck-profiles.mjs).
# Must never be eol-smudged or the byte-compared drift gate breaks on Windows.
*.streamDeckProfile binary
# Unified patch context prefixes legitimately precede upstream tab indentation.
patches/*.patch -whitespace
